msgstr "Nobena kamera ni brez govorcev, zato ni splošnega plana: štiri nastavitve splošnega plana in kljukica za robove ne učinkujejo. Eni kameri v polju Vrsta nastavite „Splošni plan“ ali pustite eno brez govorca."

msgid "placed by phase, sharpness %s against a floor of %s, drift unknown"
msgstr "umeščeno po fazi, ostrina %s ob spodnji meji %s, drsenje neznano"

msgid "placed on the bands that move"
msgstr "umeščeno po frekvenčnih pasovih, ki se spreminjajo"

msgid "Why the wide shot settings are grey"
msgstr "Zakaj so nastavitve splošnega plana sive"

msgid "because no speaker is assigned to it"
msgstr "ker ji ni dodeljen noben govorec"

msgid "marked as the wide shot -- it takes no speakers"
msgstr "označena kot splošni plan -- ne prevzame govorcev"

msgid "no speaker is assigned to it, but the cut uses %s"
msgstr "ji ni dodeljen noben govorec, vendar montaža uporablja %s"

msgid "the cut uses %s"
msgstr "montaža uporablja %s"

msgid "Curve and colour space are missing from the file"
msgstr "Krivulja in barvni prostor manjkata v datoteki"

msgid "In point and Out point are available once the time axis is set -- from the timecode or measured."
msgstr "Vstopna in izstopna točka sta na voljo, ko je časovna os določena -- iz časovne kode ali z meritvijo."

msgid "In point is %s before the first frame"
msgstr "Vstopna točka je %s pred prvo sličico"

msgid "In point is now %s, but the existing files belong to %s.\n  The audio in the videos is cut to the old window -- press Start\n  above again."
msgstr "Vstopna točka je zdaj %s, obstoječe datoteke pa pripadajo %s.\n  Zvok v videih je odrezan na staro okno -- znova kliknite „Začni“\n  zgoraj."

msgid "Out point is %s after the last frame"
msgstr "Izstopna točka je %s za zadnjo sličico"

msgid "Out point is now %s; the window would be %s long, the existing\n  files are %s -- press Start above again."
msgstr "Izstopna točka je zdaj %s; okno bi bilo dolgo %s, obstoječe\n  datoteke pa %s -- znova kliknite „Začni“ zgoraj."

msgid "Delivery usually takes the limited range. Full is not wrong, but some players misread it."
msgstr "Za izvoz se običajno uporablja omejeni razpon. Polni ni napačen, a ga nekateri predvajalniki napačno razberejo."

msgid "Determines how auphonic.com processes the audio.\n\n\"%s\" leaves the key in place and still does not go there.\nThe audio is then only merged and normalised, not unmixed --\nand without separate tracks there is no camera cut."
msgstr "Določa, kako auphonic.com obdela zvok.\n\n„%s“ pusti ključ na mestu in vseeno ne gre tja.\nZvok se tedaj le združi in normalizira, ne loči --\nbrez ločenih sledi pa ni montaže kamer."

msgid "Distance to mean"
msgstr "Odmik od povprečja"

msgid "Drag audio and video files here"
msgstr "Sem povlecite zvočne in video datoteke"

msgid "Dry run: only measuring, nothing written, nothing uploaded."
msgstr "Poskusni zagon: samo merjenje, nič se ne zapiše, nič se ne naloži."

msgid "During greeting and farewell the picture stays wide."
msgstr "Med pozdravom in slovesom ostane slika v splošnem planu."

msgid "The frames stand a little longer; the file is not any shorter for it. Editing software repeats about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "Sličice stojijo malo dlje; datoteka zaradi tega ni nič krajša. Program za montažo ponovi približno eno sličico vsakih %s s, slika in zvok kamere pa ostaneta skupaj."

msgid "The frames stand a little shorter; the file is not any longer for it. Editing software leaves out about one frame every %s s, and picture and camera audio stay together."
msgstr "Sličice stojijo malo manj časa; datoteka zaradi tega ni nič daljša. Program za montažo izpusti približno eno sličico vsakih %s s, slika in zvok kamere pa ostaneta skupaj."

msgid "Eight bits are not enough for HDR: every gradient bands, and YouTube requires ten or twelve."
msgstr "Osem bitov za HDR ni dovolj: v vsakem prelivu nastanejo pasovi, YouTube pa zahteva deset ali dvanajst."

msgid "Envelope"
msgstr "Ovojnica"

msgid "  %s is placed on %s, which is no camera of this run -- the cut names it all the same."
msgstr "  %s stoji na %s, ki ni kamera tega zagona -- montaža jo vseeno navede."

msgid "Envelope failed: %s"
msgstr "Ovojnica ni uspela: %s"

msgid "Envelopes and camera audio are prepared in the background."
msgstr "Ovojnice in zvok kamer se pripravljajo v ozadju."

msgid "Every row needs a name -- at Auphonic it becomes the track ID."
msgstr "Vsaka vrstica potrebuje ime -- pri Auphonicu postane track ID."

msgid "External preview -- the app does not know this format"
msgstr "Zunanji predogled -- aplikacija ne pozna te oblike"

msgid "Fetching audio"
msgstr "Pridobivanje zvoka"

msgid "Fetching audio ..."
msgstr "Pridobivanje zvoka ..."

msgid "File"
msgstr "Datoteka"

msgid "Files are missing there -- without a new upload nothing can be computed.\n  With --auphonic-resume upload the script uploads again; this costs credit."
msgstr "Tam manjkajo datoteke -- brez novega nalaganja ni mogoče ničesar izračunati.\n  Z --auphonic-resume upload skript znova naloži; to porabi dobroimetje."

msgid "For HDR the usual choice is HEVC (Main 10), AV1 or VP9 Profile 2. YouTube takes H.264 too, but it needs more bitrate."
msgstr "Za HDR je običajna izbira HEVC (Main 10), AV1 ali VP9 Profile 2. YouTube sprejme tudi H.264, vendar ta potrebuje večjo bitno hitrost."

msgid "For ten bits HEVC needs the Main 10 profile. In Resolve it sits under Deliver as \"Profile\"."
msgstr "Za deset bitov HEVC potrebuje profil Main 10. V Resolve je pod Deliver kot „Profile“."

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s fewer frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s sličic/s namesto %s v datoteki -- za %s manj sličic na isti dolžini."

msgid "%s fps, not the %s in the file -- %s more frames in the same length."
msgstr "%s sličic/s namesto %s v datoteki -- za %s več sličic na isti dolžini."

msgid "Frame spacing varies by %s %% -- the frame timing is uneven."
msgstr "Razmik med sličicami niha za %s %% -- časovni razpored sličic je neenakomeren."

msgid "Free space there: %s"
msgstr "Prosti prostor tam: %s"

msgid "Gap of %s between block %d and %d -- the camera stopped."
msgstr "Vrzel %s med blokom %d in %d -- kamera se je ustavila."

msgid "Drag to move the position."
msgstr "Povlecite, da premaknete položaj."

msgid "HDR needs 16 here (PQ, that is HDR10) or 18 (HLG). In Resolve: Gamma tag = ST.2084 or HLG. 14 is not an HDR curve but SDR in the BT.2020 space."
msgstr "Za HDR mora biti tukaj 16 (PQ, torej HDR10) ali 18 (HLG). V Resolve: Gamma tag = ST.2084 ali HLG. 14 ni krivulja HDR, temveč SDR v prostoru BT.2020."

msgid "HDR needs 9 here (BT.2020). In Resolve: Color space tag = Rec.2020."
msgstr "Za HDR mora biti tukaj 9 (BT.2020). V Resolve: Color space tag = Rec.2020."

msgid "HDR needs 9 here (BT.2020, non-constant luminance)."
msgstr "Za HDR mora biti tukaj 9 (BT.2020, nekonstantna svetilnost)."

msgid "HLG is display-referred -- it has no entry for the mastering display."
msgstr "HLG je vezan na zaslon -- nima vnosa za zaslon za mastering."

msgid "If empty: next to each video file."
msgstr "Če je prazno: poleg vsake video datoteke."

msgid "It arose during the recording and cannot be changed now. The less the microphones are separated, the more cautiously De-Bleed at auphonic.com can work. Next time: three times as far from the neighbouring microphone as from your own mouth, then the neighbouring voice sits about %s dB lower."
msgstr "Nastalo je pri snemanju in se ga zdaj ne da več spremeniti. Manj ko so mikrofoni ločeni, bolj previdno lahko deluje De-Bleed na auphonic.com. Naslednjič: od sosednjega mikrofona trikrat dlje kot od lastnih ust, potem je sosednji glas približno %s dB tišji."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material, so it cannot be cut into the episode: set to Intro."
msgstr "Datoteka %s se ne ujema z ničemer v gradivu, zato je ni mogoče vmontirati v epizodo: nastavljena kot Uvodna špica."

msgid "%s fits nothing in the material either, and the intro is taken: left out."
msgstr "Tudi datoteka %s se ne ujema z ničemer v gradivu, uvodna špica pa je že zasedena: izpuščena."

msgid "%s is already set as %s, and an episode has one of those. Answer differently here, or take the mark off that file first."
msgstr "Datoteka %s je že nastavljena kot %s, epizoda pa ima samo eno takšno. Tu odgovorite drugače ali pa najprej odstranite oznako pri tisti datoteki."

msgid "It is in the logs atom of the picture description -- that is how Resolve recognises the input colour space. Different curves mean different input colour spaces."
msgstr "To je zapisano v atomu logs v opisu slike -- po tem Resolve prepozna vhodni barvni prostor. Različne krivulje pomenijo različne vhodne barvne prostore."

msgid "Jumps to the end of the window."
msgstr "Skoči na konec okna."

msgid "Jumps to the start of the window."
msgstr "Skoči na začetek okna."

msgid "Keychain"
msgstr "Keychain"

msgid "Limits the de-bleed: "
msgstr "Omejuje De-Bleed: "

msgid "Load Presets and pick one, or leave the API Key empty."
msgstr "Prenesite prednastavitve in izberite eno ali pustite ključ API prazen."

msgid "Main10 rejected -- the default stays"
msgstr "Main10 zavrnjen -- ostane privzeta nastavitev"

msgid "Measure only -- nothing is written or uploaded."
msgstr "Samo merjenje -- nič se ne zapiše ali naloži."

msgid "Measuring %s (%s of %s)"
msgstr "Merjenje: %s (%s od %s)"

msgid "Measuring not possible: %s"
msgstr "Merjenje ni mogoče: %s"

msgid "Measuring the yardstick"
msgstr "Merjenje merila"

msgid "Measuring time axis ..."
msgstr "Merjenje časovne osi ..."

msgid "Missing audio %s filled with silence%s"
msgstr "Manjkajoči zvok %s je zapolnjen s tišino%s"

msgid "Module DaVinciResolveScript cannot be loaded: %s"
msgstr "Modula DaVinciResolveScript ni mogoče naložiti: %s"

msgid "One audio track per person, kept apart all the way to auphonic.com.\nWorks without it as well -- then without de-bleed and leveler.\nIt needs two input tracks: a recording of its own, a channel of a\nmultichannel recorder, or the audio of a video file set to \"use\nthe audio\". The camera cut does not need this tick."
msgstr "Ena zvočna sled na osebo, ločeno vse do auphonic.com.\nDeluje tudi brez tega -- takrat brez De-Bleed in Leveler.\nPotrebni sta dve vhodni sledi: lasten posnetek, kanal večkanalnega\nsnemalnika ali zvok video datoteke, nastavljene na „z notranjim zvokom“.\nMontaža kamer te kljukice ne potrebuje."

msgid "Multitrack (one track per speaker)"
msgstr "Multitrack (ena sled na govorca)"

msgid "Multitrack needs at least two input tracks. A track is a recording of its own, a channel of a multichannel recorder, or the audio of a video file set to \"use internal audio\". Several blocks of the same recording count as one, tracks set aside not at all."
msgstr "Multitrack potrebuje vsaj dve vhodni sledi. Sled je lasten posnetek, kanal večkanalnega snemalnika ali zvok video datoteke, nastavljene na „z notranjim zvokom“. Več blokov istega posnetka šteje kot ena, odložene sledi pa sploh ne."

msgid "No API key. Pass --auphonic-api-key KEY, set AUPHONIC_TOKEN or have it remembered once in the interface. The key is in the Auphonic account settings."
msgstr "Ni ključa API. Podajte --auphonic-api-key KEY, nastavite AUPHONIC_TOKEN ali ga enkrat shranite v vmesniku. Ključ je v nastavitvah računa Auphonic."

msgid "No audio file carries a timecode. In point and Out point count from the start of the material -- the position of the files to each other is measured."
msgstr "Nobena zvočna datoteka nima časovne kode. Vstopna in izstopna točka se štejeta od začetka gradiva -- lega datotek med seboj je izmerjena."

msgid "No sound in use yet -- add an audio recording, or set a video file's Camera audio to \"use internal audio\" in the file list."
msgstr "Zvok še ni v uporabi -- dodajte zvočni posnetek ali na seznamu datotek pri video datoteki nastavite Zvok kamere na „z notranjim zvokom“."

msgid "No audio tracks are assigned."
msgstr "Nobena zvočna sled ni dodeljena."

msgid "No camera is assigned, so there is nothing to cut between."
msgstr "Nobena kamera ni dodeljena, zato ni ničesar, med čimer bi rezali."

msgid "No cameras assigned yet -- switch Multitrack on to do that."
msgstr "Kamere še niso dodeljene -- za to vklopite Multitrack."

msgid "No connection to Resolve.\n  Is the program running? Is external scripting set to 'Local'\n  under Preferences > System > General?"
msgstr "Ni povezave z Resolve.\n  Ali program teče? Ali je zunanje skriptiranje nastavljeno na 'Local'\n  pod Preferences > System > General?"

msgid "No files or project opened yet."
msgstr "Odprta še ni nobena datoteka ali projekt."

msgid "No files selected yet."
msgstr "Izbrana še ni nobena datoteka."

msgid "No input possible. Use %s %s to set what should happen."
msgstr "Vnos ni mogoč. Z %s %s določite, kaj naj se zgodi."

msgid "No player is built in here -- playback runs in ffplay in its own window."
msgstr "Tu ni vgrajenega predvajalnika -- predvajanje teče v ffplay v lastnem oknu."

msgid "No preset given, no input possible. Choose one of the above with --auphonic-preset NAME."
msgstr "Prednastavitev ni podana, vnos ni mogoč. Eno od zgornjih izberite z --auphonic-preset NAME."

msgid "No presets stored in the account. One can be created in the web interface."
msgstr "V računu ni shranjenih prednastavitev. Eno lahko ustvarite v spletnem vmesniku."

msgid "No speaker is known here -- without who speaks when there is nothing to cut between."
msgstr "Tu ni znan noben govorec -- brez tega, kdo govori kdaj, ni ničesar, med čimer bi rezali."

msgid "No voice has a camera yet -- with that every shot would be the same one."
msgstr "Noben glas še nima kamere -- tako bi bil vsak kader isti."

msgid "No speakers known yet -- nothing measured, nothing separated, and no handover file of an earlier run in %s or its subfolders."
msgstr "Govorci še niso znani -- nič ni izmerjeno, nič ločeno in ni datoteke predaje iz prejšnjega zagona v mapi %s ali njenih podmapah."

msgid "Not found again after import: %s"
msgstr "Po uvozu ni bilo znova najdeno: %s"

msgid "from ffmpeg.org, and the folder into PATH"
msgstr "z ffmpeg.org in mapo v PATH"

msgid "over the package manager: apt install ffmpeg, dnf install ffmpeg"
msgstr "prek upravitelja paketov: apt install ffmpeg, dnf install ffmpeg"

msgid "Here: %s. Needed: %s or newer."
msgstr "Tukaj: %s. Potrebna: %s ali novejša."

msgid "no answer"
msgstr "ni odgovora"

msgid "Nothing runs until that is put right."
msgstr "Nič ne deluje, dokler to ni urejeno."

msgid "Nothing runs until that is put right. This way: %s"
msgstr "Nič ne deluje, dokler to ni urejeno. Takole: %s"

msgid "Get it: %s"
msgstr "Pridobi: %s"

msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Končaj"

msgid "That worked."
msgstr "To je uspelo."

msgid "Installing ffmpeg"
msgstr "Nameščanje ffmpeg"

msgid "Start the program again to pick it up."
msgstr "Znova zaženite program, da ga upošteva."

msgid "Getting it takes a few minutes, and what it says appears under Output."
msgstr "Prenos traja nekaj minut, njegova sporočila pa se prikažejo na zavihku „Izhod“."

msgid "This takes a few minutes -- a package manager may build from source. What it says appears here."
msgstr "To traja nekaj minut -- upravitelj paketov morda gradi iz izvorne kode. Kar sporoča, se prikaže tukaj."

msgid "Now it is being compiled, and that is the long part: minutes on a fast machine and a good deal longer on an older one. Nothing is stuck -- a dot appears every few seconds for as long as it works."
msgstr "Zdaj se prevaja in to je dolgi del: na hitrem računalniku minute, na starejšem precej dlje. Nič se ni zataknilo -- dokler dela, se vsakih nekaj sekund prikaže pika."

msgid "ffmpeg is in place."
msgstr "ffmpeg je na mestu."

msgid "The program reads it when it starts. It can start again now, or you can do that yourself later."
msgstr "Program to prebere ob zagonu. Zdaj se lahko znova zažene, ali pa to storite sami pozneje."

msgid "Start again now"
msgstr "Znova zaženi zdaj"

msgid "Starting again did not work. Close the window and start the program the way you did before."
msgstr "Ponovni zagon ni uspel. Zaprite okno in zaženite program kot prej."

msgid "  Taking the ffmpeg that is there out of the way first: %s"
msgstr "  Najprej se obstoječi ffmpeg umakne: %s"

msgid "  A built ffmpeg 9.0.1 with soxr can be fetched: %s"
msgstr "  Prenesete lahko že zgrajen ffmpeg 9.0.1 s soxr: %s"

msgid "  Fetch it now? [Y/n] "
msgstr "  Prenesem zdaj? [Y/n] "

msgid "  Fetching a built ffmpeg. It is a big one, so this takes a few minutes: %s"
msgstr "  Prenaša se že zgrajen ffmpeg. Je velik, zato to traja nekaj minut: %s"

msgid "  %s of %s MB"
msgstr "  %s od %s MB"

msgid "The build could not be fetched: %s"
msgstr "Zgrajene različice ni bilo mogoče prenesti: %s"

msgid "  The build could not be unpacked: %s"
msgstr "  Zgrajene različice ni bilo mogoče razpakirati: %s"

msgid "  The archive held %s of the two programs."
msgstr "  Arhiv je vseboval %s od obeh programov."

msgid "  It is here: %s"
msgstr "  Nahaja se tukaj: %s"

msgid "install Homebrew from brew.sh, then this again"
msgstr "namestite Homebrew z brew.sh, nato to znova"

msgid "This ffmpeg has soxr: the clock drift between cameras comes out in steps of 0.21 ppm."
msgstr "Ta ffmpeg ima soxr: drsenje ure med kamerami se izravna v korakih po 0,21 ppm."

msgid "This ffmpeg has no soxr: the clock drift between cameras comes out in steps of 21 ppm instead of 0.21."
msgstr "Ta ffmpeg nima soxr: drsenje ure med kamerami se izravna v korakih po 21 ppm namesto 0,21."

msgid "Everything works without it. Getting a build that has it takes a few minutes, and what it says appears under Output."
msgstr "Vse deluje tudi brez njega. Prenos različice, ki ga ima, traja nekaj minut, njegova sporočila pa se prikažejo na zavihku „Izhod“."

msgid "Carry on"
msgstr "Nadaljuj"

msgid "Not mandatory -- YouTube then applies default values (Sony BVM-X300). To get them: in Resolve switch on HDR10+ under Color Management, run \"Analyze All Shots\" on the Color page and tick \"Embed HDR10 Metadata\" when rendering."
msgstr "Ni obvezno -- YouTube takrat uporabi privzete vrednosti (Sony BVM-X300). Če jih želite: v Resolve vklopite HDR10+ pod Color Management, na strani Color zaženite „Analyze All Shots“ in pri izvozu označite „Embed HDR10 Metadata“."

msgid "Not ready yet:"
msgstr "Še ni pripravljeno:"

msgid "Nothing was audible in the tracks."
msgstr "V sledeh ni bilo nič slišati."

msgid "One audio recording has no speaker name yet."
msgstr "En zvočni posnetek še nima imena govorca."

msgid "One frame back."
msgstr "Eno sličico nazaj."

msgid "One second back."
msgstr "Eno sekundo nazaj."

msgid "Each shot in the colour of its camera. Hover for camera and duration, click to jump."
msgstr "Vsak kader v barvi svoje kamere. Pokažite z miško za kamero in trajanje, kliknite za skok."

msgid "Only one speaker"
msgstr "Samo en govorec"

msgid "Open json project file"
msgstr "Odpri projektno datoteko json"

msgid "Open result folder"
msgstr "Odpri mapo z rezultatom"

msgid "Open the settings, where the key is."
msgstr "Odprite nastavitve, kjer je ključ."

msgid "Order does not matter. For a multi-part recording the first block is enough."
msgstr "Vrstni red ni pomemben. Pri večdelnem posnetku zadošča prvi blok."

msgid "Overwrite"
msgstr "Prepiši"

msgid "Overwrite files"
msgstr "Prepiši datoteke"

msgid "Pane %d loads %s (%s)"
msgstr "Podokno %d nalaga %s (%s)"

msgid "Pane %d on %s"
msgstr "Podokno %d za %s"

msgid "Play and pause -- the space bar works too."
msgstr "Predvajanje in premor -- deluje tudi preslednica."

msgid "Play and pause."
msgstr "Predvajanje in premor."

msgid "Playback not possible"
msgstr "Predvajanje ni mogoče"

msgid "Playing %s -- the processed track from auphonic.com,\nbrought to broadcast level. The same audio as in the camera cut."
msgstr "Predvaja se: %s -- obdelana sled z auphonic.com,\nprivedena na raven za oddajanje. Isti zvok kot v montaži kamer."

msgid "Playing %s -- the raw recording.\nIt is much quieter than the processed audio; once the tracks from auphonic.com\nare there, the preview takes those."
msgstr "Predvaja se: %s -- neobdelani posnetek.\nJe precej tišji od obdelanega zvoka; ko so sledi z auphonic.com\nna voljo, predogled uporabi njih."

msgid "Possible reasons:\n  1. Resolve is not running -- the interface answers only while the program runs.\n  2. Preferences > System > General: external scripting is set to \"None\" instead of \"Local\".\n  3. Free edition: external scripting is reported to be reserved for the Studio edition since version 19.1. I found no official statement -- this check measures it instead of claiming it."
msgstr "Možni razlogi:\n  1. Resolve ne teče -- vmesnik odgovarja le, dokler program teče.\n  2. Preferences > System > General: zunanje skriptiranje je nastavljeno na „None“ namesto „Local“.\n  3. Brezplačna izdaja: menda je zunanje skriptiranje od različice 19.1 pridržano izdaji Studio. Uradne izjave nisem našel -- to preverjanje to izmeri, namesto da bi trdilo."

msgid "Prepare pane %d for %s"
msgstr "Pripravi podokno %d za %s"

msgid "Preset not readable: %s"
msgstr "Prednastavitve ni mogoče prebrati: %s"

msgid "Preview not possible: %s"
msgstr "Predogled ni mogoč: %s"

msgid "Preview running ..."
msgstr "Predogled teče ..."

msgid "Prework -- read audio and compute envelopes:\n"
msgstr "Priprava -- branje zvoka in izračun ovojnic:\n"

msgid "Primaries"
msgstr "Primarne barve"

msgid "Primaries number %d"
msgstr "Primarne barve številka %d"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com (optional)"
msgstr "Obdelava na auphonic.com (neobvezno)"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com with \"%s\""
msgstr "Obdelava na auphonic.com s prednastavitvijo „%s“"

msgid "Production finished, but no ZIP with the individual tracks"
msgstr "Produkcija je končana, vendar ni ZIP-a s posameznimi sledmi"

msgid "Production name"
msgstr "Ime produkcije"

msgid "Chosen files"
msgstr "Izbrane datoteke"

msgid "Remove the chosen file from the list"
msgstr "Odstrani izbrano datoteko s seznama"

msgid "Project %r could not be created."
msgstr "Projekta %r ni bilo mogoče ustvariti."

msgid "Project %r could not be created. Is the name already in another folder?"
msgstr "Projekta %r ni bilo mogoče ustvariti. Ali je ime že v drugi mapi?"

msgid "Project %r could not be opened."
msgstr "Projekta %r ni bilo mogoče odpreti."

msgid "Puts it back next to each video file."
msgstr "Vrne ga nazaj poleg vsake video datoteke."

msgid "ROLLBACK FAILED (%s)"
msgstr "RAZVELJAVITEV NI USPELA (%s)"

msgid "Reading audio track from %s"
msgstr "Branje zvočne sledi iz datoteke %s"

msgid "Resolutions"
msgstr "Ločljivosti"

msgid "Resolve running ..."
msgstr "Resolve teče ..."

msgid "Resolve scales to the Timeline resolution. Anything smaller is scaled up and gets softer."
msgstr "Resolve skalira na ločljivost Timeline. Vse manjše se poveča in postane mehkejše."

msgid "Response was not JSON: %s"
msgstr "Odgovor ni bil JSON: %s"

msgid "Rows marked red show where the problem is; a tick on the tab means everything is there."
msgstr "Rdeče označene vrstice kažejo, kje je težava; kljukica na zavihku pomeni, da je tam vse na voljo."

msgid "Save in Keychain"
msgstr "Shrani v Keychain"

msgid "Save in Registry"
msgstr "Shrani v register"

msgid "Select audio and video files"
msgstr "Izberite zvočne in video datoteke"

msgid "Speakers, as the run measured them"
msgstr "Govorci, kot jih je izmeril zagon"

msgid "Speakers, self-measured from the tracks"
msgstr "Govorci, izmerjeni tukaj iz samih sledi"

msgid "Started late or stopped early -- this voice is then missing from the mix in places."
msgstr "Snemanje se je začelo pozno ali končalo zgodaj -- ta glas potem v miksu mestoma manjka."

msgid "Stopped. Choose another production name -- then a new production\n  is created -- or pick one of the other options."
msgstr "Ustavljeno. Izberite drugo ime produkcije -- potem se ustvari nova\n  produkcija -- ali pa izberite eno od drugih možnosti."

msgid "Stopped. Nothing was created."
msgstr "Ustavljeno. Nič ni bilo ustvarjeno."

msgid "Stopped. Nothing was uploaded and nothing computed."
msgstr "Ustavljeno. Nič ni bilo naloženo in nič izračunano."

msgid "Used as it stands -- nothing is invented. Check in Resolve under Clip Attributes, tab Color Space: if it says \"Project\" there, the input colour space was not recognised and has to be set by hand."
msgstr "Uporabi se, kakor je -- nič se ne izmišlja. Preverite v Resolve pod Clip Attributes, zavihek Color Space: če tam piše „Project“, vhodni barvni prostor ni bil prepoznan in ga je treba nastaviti ročno."

msgid "Takes the position from the picture."
msgstr "Prevzame položaj iz slike."

msgid "Ten seconds back."
msgstr "Deset sekund nazaj."

msgid "The Resolve interface is not where I expect it:\n  %s\n  %s"
msgstr "Vmesnik Resolve ni tam, kjer ga pričakujem:\n  %s\n  %s"

msgid "The Resolve interface is not where it should be."
msgstr "Vmesnik Resolve ni tam, kjer bi moral biti."

msgid "The Timeline gets one fixed rate -- the highest of them, or the next rate Resolve has above it. It converts the others; with 23.976 against 24 that is where its audio analysis tends to stall."
msgstr "Timeline dobi eno fiksno hitrost -- najvišjo med njimi ali naslednjo višjo, ki jo Resolve pozna. Ostale pretvori; pri 23,976 proti 24 se prav tam njegova analiza zvoka rada zatakne."

msgid "The audio recording of every speaker, plus the cameras.\nThe order does not matter -- the program recognises what is what.\nFor a multi-part recording the first block is enough."
msgstr "Zvočni posnetek vsakega govorca in kamere.\nVrstni red ni pomemben -- program prepozna, kaj je kaj.\nPri večdelnem posnetku zadošča prvi blok."

msgid "The cut has no picture there. When the Timeline is built the spot stays empty, the audio runs on."
msgstr "Montaža tam nima slike. Pri gradnji Timeline to mesto ostane prazno, zvok teče naprej."

msgid "The existing result is unusable: %s is missing there. With --auphonic-resume rerun it can be recomputed without uploading anything."
msgstr "Obstoječi rezultat ni uporaben: tam manjka %s. Z --auphonic-resume rerun ga je mogoče znova izračunati, ne da bi se karkoli naložilo."

msgid "The cut rules leave no shot standing in these %s. A shorter shortest shot, or less wide shot, gives one again."
msgstr "Pravila montaže v tem času (%s) ne pustijo nobenega kadra. Krajša najmanjša dolžina kadra ali manj splošnega plana spet da kader."

msgid "The programme is %s long here -- nothing can be laid out in that. In point and Out point are what set it."
msgstr "Oddaja je tu dolga %s -- vanjo ni mogoče ničesar razporediti. Določata jo vstopna in izstopna točka."

msgid "The time window lies outside the material: In point at %s, Out point at %s, and the material runs %s."
msgstr "Časovno okno leži zunaj gradiva: vstopna točka pri %s, izstopna točka pri %s, gradivo pa traja %s."

msgid "The first preset track sets the settings for all our tracks. Otherwise they come back unprocessed. Create a track in the preset in the web interface."
msgstr "Prva sled prednastavitve določa nastavitve za vse naše sledi. Sicer se vrnejo neobdelane. V spletnem vmesniku ustvarite sled v prednastavitvi."

msgid "That needs the handover file from a run, and there is none."
msgstr "Za to je potrebna datoteka predaje iz zagona, te pa ni."

msgid "The key can only be stored on Mac and Windows -- in the keychain or the registry. It does not go into a file."
msgstr "Ključ je mogoče shraniti le na Macu in v Windows -- v Keychain ali v register. V datoteko ne gre."

msgid "%s -- being checked"
msgstr "%s -- preverjanje"

msgid "The key was not saved: %s"
msgstr "Ključ ni bil shranjen: %s"

msgid "The keychain is locked. Unlock it and try again."
msgstr "Keychain je zaklenjen. Odklenite ga in poskusite znova."

msgid "This run is a test run and the store still carries its real name, so nothing was written. Point KEY_SERVICE, KEY_ACCOUNT or REG_PATH somewhere else first."
msgstr "Ta zagon je preizkusni, shramba pa še vedno nosi svoje pravo ime, zato ni bilo nič zapisano. Najprej usmerite KEY_SERVICE, KEY_ACCOUNT ali REG_PATH drugam."

msgid "The keychain is locked. Unlock it and this button wakes up."
msgstr "Keychain je zaklenjen. Odklenite ga in ta gumb se bo aktiviral."

msgid "The keychain did not take the key. Keychain Access can say why."
msgstr "Keychain ni sprejel ključa. Keychain Access lahko pove, zakaj."

msgid "The registry did not take the key."
msgstr "Register ni sprejel ključa."

msgid "Open Keychain Access"
msgstr "Odpri Keychain Access"

msgid "Opens the app that unlocks the keychain."
msgstr "Odpre aplikacijo, ki odklene Keychain."

msgid "  Keychain Access could not be opened: %s"
msgstr "  Keychain Access ni bilo mogoče odpreti: %s"

msgid "The stored key is not accepted: %s"
msgstr "Shranjeni ključ ni sprejet: %s"

msgid "The key from AUPHONIC_TOKEN is not accepted: %s"
msgstr "Ključ iz AUPHONIC_TOKEN ni sprejet: %s"

msgid "What auphonic.com replied"
msgstr "Kaj je odgovoril auphonic.com"

msgid "There is no key."
msgstr "Ključa ni."

msgid "The key has a space or a line break at one end."
msgstr "Ključ ima na enem koncu presledek ali prelom vrstice."

msgid "The key is broken in the middle by a space or a line break."
msgstr "Ključ je na sredini prekinjen s presledkom ali prelomom vrstice."

msgid "The key has a character in it that cannot be typed."
msgstr "Ključ vsebuje znak, ki ga ni mogoče natipkati."

msgid "The key is then in the %s, never in a file."
msgstr "Ključ je potem tukaj: %s -- nikoli v datoteki."

msgid "The production has no name yet."
msgstr "Produkcija še nima imena."

msgid "The recording assigned to this camera instead of the camera audio."
msgstr "Posnetek, dodeljen tej kameri, namesto zvoka kamere."

msgid "The run is still going."
msgstr "Zagon še teče."

msgid "No speakers are known yet -- they are worked out of the tracks as soon as this tab is opened. Where everybody is on one recording, \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field is the way."
msgstr "Govorci še niso znani -- iz sledi se izluščijo, takoj ko se odpre ta zavihek. Kadar so vsi na enem posnetku, je prava pot „več govorcev“ v polju Ime govorca."

msgid "The three numbers are primaries, curve and matrix. Different tags need different input colour spaces in Resolve -- otherwise one camera looks unlike the other."
msgstr "Tri številke so primarne barve, krivulja in matrika. Različne oznake zahtevajo različne vhodne barvne prostore v Resolve -- sicer je ena kamera videti drugače kot druga."

msgid "There are no separate audio recordings. Then the audio of the %s cameras is used -- each becomes a track, and Auphonic removes the bleed."
msgstr "Ni ločenih zvočnih posnetkov. Potem se uporabi zvok kamer (%s) -- vsaka postane sled, Auphonic pa odstrani presluh."

msgid "There is no result yet."
msgstr "Rezultata še ni."

msgid "These files are neither audio nor video and stay out:\n\n  %s"
msgstr "Te datoteke niso ne zvok ne video in ostanejo zunaj:\n\n  %s"

msgid "These files do not exist:\n  "
msgstr "Te datoteke ne obstajajo:\n  "

msgid "These files exist already and will be written again:\n\n  %s\n\nIs that intended?"
msgstr "Te datoteke že obstajajo in bodo znova zapisane:\n\n  %s\n\nJe to namerno?"

msgid "These files no longer exist:\n  "
msgstr "Te datoteke ne obstajajo več:\n  "

msgid "These names occur more than once:\n\n  %s\n\nThe recordings are merged into one track and laid end to end by their timecode. That is right if recording was stopped in between."
msgstr "Ta imena se pojavijo večkrat:\n\n  %s\n\nPosnetki se združijo v eno sled in se po svoji časovni kodi postavijo drug za drugim. To je prav, če je bilo snemanje vmes ustavljeno."

msgid "These tracks got no file: %s"
msgstr "Te sledi niso dobile datoteke: %s"

msgid "This Resolve project already exists"
msgstr "Ta projekt Resolve že obstaja"

msgid "This comes from the recording, not afterwards: the microphones sit too close together or too far from the mouth."
msgstr "To nastane pri snemanju, ne pozneje: mikrofoni so preblizu skupaj ali predaleč od ust."

msgid "This file cannot be played here, and ffplay is missing as a fallback."
msgstr "Te datoteke tukaj ni mogoče predvajati, ffplay kot rezerva pa manjka."

msgid "This is not a project file, and there is none in the same folder.\n\nThe search is for %s*.json -- the script writes it into the output folder at start."
msgstr "To ni projektna datoteka in v isti mapi je ni.\n\nIšče se %s*.json -- skript jo ob zagonu zapiše v izhodno mapo."

msgid "This is what happens next"
msgstr "Kaj sledi"

msgid "This name is on somebody else already. A name is a person, and the cut puts a person on one camera -- please give this voice its own."
msgstr "To ime že ima nekdo drug. Ime je oseba in montaža postavi osebo na eno kamero -- prosimo, dajte temu glasu lastno ime."

msgid "This name occurs more than once. The recordings would become one track -- for Multitrack auphonic.com needs at least two different ones."
msgstr "To ime se pojavi večkrat. Posnetki bi postali ena sled -- za Multitrack auphonic.com potrebuje vsaj dve različni."

msgid "This production already exists"
msgstr "Ta produkcija že obstaja"

msgid "This production has no result yet."
msgstr "Ta produkcija še nima rezultata."

msgid "Time limit of %s reached, production still running: %s/engine/status/%s"
msgstr "Dosežena časovna omejitev %s, produkcija še teče: %s/engine/status/%s"

msgid "Timecode %s, the other files are at %s -- this clock was not set."
msgstr "Časovna koda %s, ostale datoteke so pri %s -- ta ura ni bila nastavljena."

msgid "Timeline %r could not be created."
msgstr "Timeline %r ni bilo mogoče ustvariti."

msgid "Title at auphonic.com and start of the new file names."
msgstr "Naslov na auphonic.com in začetek novih imen datotek."

msgid "To the In point."
msgstr "Na vstopno točko."

msgid "To the start."
msgstr "Na začetek."

msgid "Too many projects with this name."
msgstr "Preveč projektov s tem imenom."

msgid "Track"
msgstr "Sled"

msgid "Tracks were added while changing (now %s). That makes the mix\n  wrong. Please delete the tracks without a file at auphonic.com."
msgstr "Med spreminjanjem so bile dodane sledi (zdaj %s). Zaradi tega bo miks\n  napačen. Prosimo, na auphonic.com izbrišite sledi brez datoteke."

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same file. The second would overwrite the first."
msgstr "Dve kameri bi ustvarili isto datoteko. Druga bi prepisala prvo."

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same file: %s"
msgstr "Dve kameri bi ustvarili isto datoteko: %s"

msgid "Two cameras would produce the same new file. Please give different names."
msgstr "Dve kameri bi ustvarili isto novo datoteko. Prosimo, določite različna imena."

msgid "Uneven frame timing cannot be evened out through the audio. If the sample points spread during alignment as well, convert to a fixed frame rate."
msgstr "Neenakomernega časovnega zaporedja sličic ni mogoče izravnati prek zvoka. Če se pri poravnavi razpršijo tudi merilne točke, pretvorite v fiksno hitrost sličic."

msgid "Video"
msgstr "Video"

msgid "Video 1"
msgstr "Video 1"

msgid "Video 2"
msgstr "Video 2"

msgid "Video Podcast Magic %s -- raw material becomes an edited podcast"
msgstr "Video Podcast Magic %s -- iz surovega gradiva nastane zmontiran podcast"

msgid "Volume. 100 is as loud as it goes -- Qt takes nothing above that."
msgstr "Jakost. 100 je največ -- Qt več ne sprejme."

msgid "%s (%s) -- talking at once counts twice"
msgstr "%s (%s) -- sočasno govorjenje se šteje dvakrat"

msgid "Wide shot at most"
msgstr "Splošni plan največ"

msgid "Wide shot at the latest"
msgstr "Splošni plan najpozneje"

msgid "Wide shot for greeting at the start and farewell at the end"
msgstr "Splošni plan za pozdrav na začetku in slovo na koncu"

msgid "Without it every player has to guess, and all guess SDR. In Resolve under Deliver > Advanced Settings set the Color space tag and the Gamma tag instead of leaving them at \"Same as Project\"."
msgstr "Brez tega mora vsak predvajalnik ugibati in vsi ugibajo SDR. V Resolve pod Deliver > Advanced Settings nastavite Color space tag in Gamma tag, namesto da ju pustite na „Same as Project“."

msgid "Without processing at auphonic.com"
msgstr "Brez obdelave na auphonic.com"

msgid "There is no camera cut yet: it needs two people, each with a name and a camera.\nSeparate recordings give that with the Multitrack tick, and so does \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field of one recording --\nthe voices found there get their camera in the table under the recordings.\nA Resolve project is created anyway -- all cameras at their measured places, ready for Multicam."
msgstr "Montaže kamer še ni: potrebni sta dve osebi, vsaka z imenom in kamero.\nLočeni posnetki to omogočijo s kljukico Multitrack, prav tako „več govorcev“ v polju Ime govorca enega posnetka --\nglasovi, najdeni tam, dobijo svojo kamero v tabeli pod posnetki.\nProjekt Resolve se vseeno ustvari -- vse kamere na svojih izmerjenih mestih, pripravljene za Multicam."

msgid "Without timecode the position of the files is measured."
msgstr "Brez časovne kode se lega datotek izmeri."

msgid "Works out who speaks when from the tracks themselves -- one microphone per person, level against its own noise floor. Where everybody is on one recording, \"several speakers\" in the Speaker name field is the way."
msgstr "Iz samih sledi izračuna, kdo govori kdaj -- en mikrofon na osebo, raven glede na lastni šum ozadja. Kadar so vsi na enem posnetku, je prava pot „več govorcev“ v polju Ime govorca."

msgid "YouTube -- turns down only, never up"
msgstr "YouTube -- samo utiša, nikoli ne ojača"

msgid "a box no longer fits into its parent"
msgstr "škatla se ne prilega več v nadrejeno škatlo"

msgid "after the device change"
msgstr "po menjavi naprave"

msgid "auphonic.com does not accept the key: %s"
msgstr "auphonic.com ne sprejme ključa: %s"

msgid "average"
msgstr "povprečje"

msgid "belongs to"
msgstr "pripada"

msgid "bleed too indistinct: %s of %s seconds usable, sharpest %s of %s needed"
msgstr "presluh preveč nejasen: uporabnih %s od %s sekund, najostrejši %s, potrebno %s"

msgid "Midnight"
msgstr "Polnoč"

msgid "%s carries a timecode from the other side of midnight -- counted as one night, not as a day apart."
msgstr "%s ima časovno kodo z druge strani polnoči -- šteje se kot ena noč, ne kot dan razlike."

msgid "A timecode counts from midnight and starts over there. The files are put on one axis before anything is subtracted, otherwise the recording after midnight looks almost a day away from the one before. If these really were recorded on different days, the alignment is wrong and the measured offset is the one to trust."
msgstr "Časovna koda se šteje od polnoči in tam začne znova. Datoteke se postavijo na eno os, preden se karkoli odšteje -- sicer je posnetek po polnoči videti skoraj dan oddaljen od prejšnjega. Če so bili ti res posneti na različne dneve, je poravnava napačna in zaupati je treba izmerjenemu zamiku."

msgid "Channel %d is against the stop: %s times three samples or more in a row, the longest %s (%s ms), the first at %s."
msgstr "Kanal %d udarja v strop -- nizi treh ali več zaporednih vzorcev: %s, najdaljši %s (%s ms), prvi pri %s."

msgid "Counted here, sample by sample, at the rate the file was recorded at: a run of three or more samples on the highest value an integer format can hold. One or two are rounding and are not reported. What is cut off there is gone and no processing brings it back -- but the recording is still the recording, and this holds nothing up. Only integer formats are counted. 32 bit float has no stop at full scale, so there is nothing there to count."
msgstr "Prešteto tukaj, vzorec za vzorcem, pri frekvenci, s katero je bila datoteka posneta: niz treh ali več vzorcev na najvišji vrednosti, ki jo celoštevilski format lahko zajame. En ali dva sta zaokroževanje in se ne sporočata. Kar je tam odrezano, je izgubljeno in nobena obdelava tega ne vrne -- a posnetek ostaja posnetek in to ničesar ne zadrži. Štejejo se le celoštevilski formati. 32-bitni float nima stropa pri polni skali, zato tam ni česa šteti."

msgid "boxes no longer readable"
msgstr "škatel ni več mogoče prebrati"

msgid "bring up to date -- both Timelines are deleted and\n       rebuilt, the media pool stays as it is"
msgstr "posodobi -- obe Timeline se izbrišeta in\n       zgradita na novo, Media Pool ostane, kakršen je"

msgid "cannot be read back (%s)"
msgstr "ni mogoče prebrati nazaj (%s)"

msgid "checking ..."
msgstr "preverjanje ..."

msgid "complete"
msgstr "popolni"

msgid "create a new project alongside (name with suffix)"
msgstr "ustvari nov projekt zraven (ime s pripono)"

msgid "curl ended with %d"
msgstr "curl se je končal s kodo %d"

msgid "did not arrive: %s"
msgstr "ni prispelo: %s"

msgid "does not belong: %s"
msgstr "ne spada zraven: %s"

