msgstr "Iz tega ni nastala montaža -- zgoraj znova kliknite „Začni“."

msgid "\nWITHOUT AUPHONIC.COM"
msgstr "\nBREZ AUPHONIC.COM"

msgid "  Bleed measured, %s in %s only %s dB quieter -- taken out of the speech detection"
msgstr "  Presluh izmerjen, %s v %s le %s dB tišje -- odšteto pri zaznavanju govora"

msgid "  Bleed not separable: %s"
msgstr "  Presluha ni mogoče ločiti: %s"

msgid "  No moment found where exactly one person speaks -- the bleed stays in the speech detection."
msgstr "  Ni bilo najdenega trenutka, ko govori natanko ena oseba -- presluh ostane v zaznavanju govora."

msgid "  Nothing was audible in the tracks -- no camera cut from this."
msgstr "  V sledeh ni bilo nič slišati -- iz tega ni montaže kamer."

msgid "  Not in the cut: %s -- a separation speaks for the recording, or it was not measured."
msgstr "  Ni v montaži: %s -- za posnetek govori ločevanje ali pa ni bil izmerjen."

msgid "  The tracks are used as recorded: aligned, mixed and brought to the\n  target loudness. No de-bleed, no leveler, no noise removal -- for\n  those the run needs auphonic.com."
msgstr "  Sledi se uporabijo, kot so bile posnete: poravnane, zmešane in\n  pripeljane na ciljno glasnost. Brez De-Bleed, brez Leveler, brez\n  odstranjevanja šuma -- za to zagon potrebuje auphonic.com."

msgid "  --without-auphonic and --auphonic-done were both given. The finished tracks win: there is nothing left to send anywhere."
msgstr "  Podana sta bila --without-auphonic in --auphonic-done. Končane sledi imajo prednost: ničesar ni več treba nikamor pošiljati."

msgid "MULTITRACK NOT POSSIBLE\n  Without an API key there is nothing to send to auphonic.com.\n  With --without-auphonic it runs locally instead: aligned,\n  mixed and cut, but without de-bleed and leveler."
msgstr "MULTITRACK NI MOGOČ\n  Brez ključa API ni ničesar za pošiljanje na auphonic.com.\n  Z --without-auphonic namesto tega teče lokalno: poravnano,\n  zmešano in zmontirano, vendar brez De-Bleed in Leveler."

msgid "  Caution: only %s of %s pairs measurable. For the rest no moment was found where exactly one person speaks, so their bleed stays in -- the speaker detection is unreliable here."
msgstr "  Pozor: merljivih je le %s od %s parov. Za ostale ni bil najden trenutek, ko govori natanko ena oseba, zato njihov presluh ostane -- zaznavanje govorcev je tu nezanesljivo."

msgid "the microphones hear each other almost as loudly as their own speaker"
msgstr "mikrofoni se medsebojno slišijo skoraj tako glasno kot lastnega govorca"

msgid "the tracks are too much alike to separate"
msgstr "sledi so si preveč podobne, da bi jih ločili"

msgid "Reading the plan"
msgstr "Branje načrta"

msgid "Audio out of the cameras"
msgstr "Zvok iz kamer"

msgid "Common time axis"
msgstr "Skupna časovna os"

msgid "Processing at auphonic.com"
msgstr "Obdelava na auphonic.com"

msgid "Loudness"
msgstr "Glasnost"

msgid "Loudness and levels"
msgstr "Glasnost in ravni"

msgid "Loudness of the finished episode"
msgstr "Glasnost končane epizode"

msgid "How loud the finished episode is made. The same gain goes on every\ntrack, so the balance between the speakers is kept.\n\"Take from source files\" adjusts nothing at all: auphonic.com goes\non doing what its preset says, and without auphonic.com the sound\nstays as it is in the source files."
msgstr "Kako glasna bo končana epizoda. Enako ojačanje gre na vsako\nsled, tako da razmerje med govorci ostane.\n„Iz izvornih datotek“ ne prilagodi ničesar: auphonic.com še naprej\ndela, kar pravi njegova prednastavitev, brez auphonic.com pa zvok\nostane tak, kot je v izvornih datotekah."

msgid "    Loudness was not adjusted -- the target below is only what the meter\n    measures against."
msgstr "    Glasnost ni bila prilagojena -- spodnji cilj je le to, proti čemur\n    meri merilnik."

msgid "Who speaks when"
msgstr "Kdo govori kdaj"

msgid "Writing the camera files"
msgstr "Zapisovanje datotek kamer"

msgid "Handover and result"
msgstr "Predaja in rezultat"

msgid "Show twice as much (minus key, or the wheel over the band)"
msgstr "Prikaže dvakrat več (tipka minus ali kolesce nad trakom)"

msgid "Show half as much, around the current position (plus key, or the wheel over the band)"
msgstr "Prikaže polovico, okoli trenutnega položaja (tipka plus ali kolesce nad trakom)"

msgid "The whole length again (0 key)"
msgstr "Spet celotna dolžina (tipka 0)"

msgid "  Also fetched: %s"
msgstr "  Preneseno tudi: %s"

msgid "Auphonic will not take the settings: %s"
msgstr "Auphonic ne sprejme nastavitev: %s"

msgid "      %s channels"
msgstr "      Kanali: %s"

msgid "measurement running ..."
msgstr "merjenje poteka ..."

msgid "      Channel %d"
msgstr "      Kanal %d"

msgid "Looking at the channels"
msgstr "Pregledovanje kanalov"

msgid "channels not readable: %s"
msgstr "kanalov ni mogoče prebrati: %s"

msgid "unused input -- ignored"
msgstr "neuporabljen vhod -- prezrt"

msgid "uncertain -- %s"
msgstr "negotovo -- %s"

msgid "set by hand -- overrides the measurement"
msgstr "nastavljeno ročno -- preglasi meritev"

msgid "both channels identical -- mono laid on both sides"
msgstr "oba kanala enaka -- mono na obeh straneh"

msgid "probably two microphones -- about %s m apart%s"
msgstr "verjetno dva mikrofona -- približno %s m narazen%s"

msgid ", agreed at %s of %s places"
msgstr ", ujemanje na %s od %s mest"

msgid "probably one stereo track -- both microphones in the same place"
msgstr "verjetno ena stereo sled -- oba mikrofona na istem mestu"

msgid "not recognisable -- only %s of %s places where both channels carry sound, %s needed"
msgstr "ni prepoznavno -- le %s od %s mest, kjer oba kanala nosita zvok, potrebno: %s"

msgid "not recognisable -- these two agree no better than each does with the channel beside it"
msgstr "ni prepoznavno -- ta dva se ne ujemata bolje kot vsak od njiju s kanalom poleg"

msgid "not set"
msgstr "ni nastavljeno"

msgid "The language spoken in the recording. It becomes the tag of the\nwritten audio track, and the recognition here is told to expect it.\nPreset from the system language. \"%s\" leaves the track untagged\nand lets the recognition work the language out itself."
msgstr "Jezik, ki se govori v posnetku. Postane oznaka\nzapisane zvočne sledi, razpoznavanje govora tukaj pa ga pričakuje.\nPrednastavljen iz jezika sistema. „%s“ pusti sled brez oznake\nin prepusti razpoznavanju govora, da jezik ugotovi samo."

