msgid "Cutting out track %d of %d"
msgstr "Izrezovanje sledi %d od %d"

msgid "cutting failed: %s"
msgstr "izrezovanje ni uspelo: %s"

msgid "  One camera for everybody: cut into %s shots at the change of speaker, so Resolve can group them."
msgstr "  Ena kamera za vse: ob menjavi govorca razrezana na kadre (%s), da jih Resolve lahko združi v skupine."

msgid "Shorter shots fall into the following one."
msgstr "Krajši kadri se priključijo naslednjemu."

msgid "Speaks at least"
msgstr "Govori vsaj"

msgid "below this the camera does not follow"
msgstr "pod tem kamera ne sledi"

msgid "A short \"yes\" does not move the picture. Without this a block of half a second draws the camera over, and the minimum edit duration then holds it there for seconds."
msgstr "Kratek „ja“ ne premakne slike. Brez tega blok pol sekunde povleče kamero k sebi, najmanjša dolžina kadra pa jo nato tam zadrži več sekund."

msgid "Answer on screen earlier"
msgstr "Odgovor prej v sliki"

msgid "before the question ends"
msgstr "pred koncem vprašanja"

msgid "Zero is where the asker stops, not where the answer starts: the pause between them belongs to the question. Applies only where \"After a question\" asks for it, and the Edit Change Delay is not added again."
msgstr "Ničla je tam, kjer spraševalec neha, ne tam, kjer se začne odgovor: premor med njima pripada vprašanju. Velja le tam, kjer to zahteva „Po vprašanju“, in Edit Change Delay se ne prišteje še enkrat."

msgid "Wide shot at least"
msgstr "Splošni plan vsaj"

msgid "so long the inserted wide shot stands at least"
msgstr "vsaj toliko traja vstavljeni splošni plan"

msgid "It then runs to the end of the sentence. Below five seconds the look reads as a twitch."
msgstr "Nato teče do konca stavka. Pod petimi sekundami pogled deluje kot trzaj."

msgid "and at most this long"
msgstr "in največ toliko"

msgid "Where the end of the sentence lies beyond it, the last clause break before it ends the shot -- it is not cut off mid-sentence."
msgstr "Kjer je konec stavka dlje, kader konča zadnja meja med deli stavka pred njim -- ne reže se sredi stavka."

msgid "Long monologue"
msgstr "Dolg monolog"

msgid "one person holds the floor past \"Wide shot after\""
msgstr "ena oseba govori dlje od „Splošni plan po“"

msgid "\"Alternating\" remembers what the last break of this monologue showed. The listener only gets the picture when someone on that camera was heard in the last 20 seconds; otherwise the wide shot."
msgstr "„Izmenično“ si zapomni, kaj je pokazal zadnji prelom tega monologa. Poslušalec dobi sliko le, če je bil kdo na tej kameri slišan v zadnjih 20 sekundah; sicer splošni plan."

msgid "Several speak at once"
msgstr "Več jih govori hkrati"

msgid "and no camera shows exactly them"
msgstr "in nobena kamera ne kaže natanko njih"

msgid "Cutting into a jumble looks frantic."
msgstr "Rezanje v zmedo deluje nervozno."

msgid "Nobody speaks"
msgstr "Nihče ne govori"

msgid "no voice is heard at all here"
msgstr "tu se sploh ne sliši noben glas"

msgid "A breath in the middle of a sentence and the end of a thought are both silence, and the program cannot tell them apart. Only the length can: \"Short gap up to\" says how long a silence may be and still count as a breath."
msgstr "Vdih sredi stavka in konec misli sta oba tišina in program ju ne more razlikovati. Le dolžina ju lahko: „Kratek premor do“ pove, kako dolga sme biti tišina, da še šteje kot vdih."

msgid "Short gap up to"
msgstr "Kratek premor do"

msgid "so long a silence leaves the picture alone"
msgstr "toliko časa tišina pusti sliko pri miru"

msgid "Only where \"Nobody speaks\" is set to hold a short gap. A gap up to this long changes nothing, a longer one goes to the wide shot. Above two seconds the picture begins to stand on someone silent for over five seconds."
msgstr "Le kjer je „Nihče ne govori“ nastavljeno na zadržanje kratkega premora. Premor do te dolžine ne spremeni ničesar, daljši gre na splošni plan. Nad dvema sekundama začne slika stati na nekom, ki molči, dlje kot pet sekund."

msgid "Recognition uncertain"
msgstr "Negotovo razpoznavanje"

msgid "the speaker recognition frays or leaves a heap behind"
msgstr "razpoznavanje govorcev se cefra ali pusti kupček"

msgid "Guessing puts the wrong person on screen for seconds; the wide shot is right in every case. Somebody is speaking here -- where nobody is, \"Nobody speaks\" decides."
msgstr "Ugibanje za več sekund pokaže napačno osebo; splošni plan je v vsakem primeru pravilen. Tu nekdo govori -- kjer nihče ne govori, odloča „Nihče ne govori“."

msgid "the picture goes to the answer before it starts"
msgstr "slika preide na odgovor, preden se ta začne"

msgid "Only after a question that is not the main speaker's, when somebody else takes over at once and keeps the floor.\n\"do not go early\" means no early camera change: the picture follows the sound here as it does everywhere else."
msgstr "Le po vprašanju, ki ga ne postavi glavni govorec, ko nekdo drug takoj prevzame besedo in jo obdrži.\n„ne prehitevaj“ pomeni brez zgodnje menjave kamere: slika tu sledi zvoku kot povsod drugod."

msgid "Wide shot"
msgstr "Splošni plan"

msgid "Wide shot %d"
msgstr "Splošni plan %d"

msgid "(wide shot)"
msgstr "(splošni plan)"

msgid "No speaker"
msgstr "Brez govorca"

msgid "Listener"
msgstr "Poslušalec"

msgid "Alternating"
msgstr "Izmenično"

msgid "No camera change"
msgstr "Brez menjave kamere"

msgid "Hold a short gap"
msgstr "Zadrži kratek premor"

msgid "do not go early"
msgstr "ne prehitevaj"

msgid "Answering speaker"
msgstr "Kdor odgovarja"

msgid "  %sx away from the speaker because a shot ran longer than %s s"
msgstr "  %s-krat stran od govorca, ker je kader trajal dlje kot %s s"

msgid "%s is in place."
msgstr "Različica %s je nameščena."

msgid "This window is still the version it started as. It can start again now and come up as that one, or you can do that yourself later."
msgstr "To okno je še vedno različica, s katero se je zagnalo. Zdaj se lahko znova zažene in odpre v tej različici, ali pa to storite sami pozneje."

msgid "This copy runs out of a folder of its own, so pip has nothing here to update. This installs it: %s"
msgstr "Ta kopija teče iz lastne mape, zato pip tu nima česa posodobiti. Tole jo namesti: %s"

msgid "Language of the window"
msgstr "Jezik okna"

msgid "A language chosen here is spoken from the next start."
msgstr "Jezik, izbran tukaj, velja od naslednjega zagona."

msgid "Restart the application"
msgstr "Znova zaženi aplikacijo"

msgid "The work can be written to a project file first."
msgstr "Delo je mogoče najprej zapisati v projektno datoteko."

msgid "Starting the application again brings it at once, and asks first what is to happen to the work. Leaving it alone costs nothing -- it comes at the next start."
msgstr "Ponovni zagon aplikacije ga uveljavi takoj in najprej vpraša, kaj naj se zgodi z delom. Če tega ne storite, ne izgubite ničesar -- jezik se zamenja ob naslednjem zagonu."

msgid "The application is about to start again. Shall the work be written to a project file first?"
msgstr "Aplikacija se bo znova zagnala. Ali naj se delo najprej zapiše v projektno datoteko?"

msgid "Written, the new window opens the project again and everything stands where it stood. Not written, it comes up empty and the files have to be added afresh."
msgstr "Če je zapisano, novo okno znova odpre projekt in vse stoji tam, kjer je stalo. Če ni zapisano, se odpre prazno in datoteke je treba dodati na novo."

msgid "Save and restart"
msgstr "Shrani in znova zaženi"

msgid "Restart without saving"
msgstr "Znova zaženi brez shranjevanja"

msgid "The run is still going. The window can be started again once it is finished."
msgstr "Zagon še poteka. Okno je mogoče znova zagnati, ko se konča."

msgid "System language (%s)"
msgstr "Jezik sistema (%s)"

msgid "A shortcut to this program was made: %s"
msgstr "Bližnjica do tega programa je bila ustvarjena: %s"

msgid "No shortcut to this program was made: %s"
msgstr "Bližnjica do tega programa ni bila ustvarjena: %s"

msgid "it was written and was not there afterwards"
msgstr "bila je zapisana, potem pa je ni bilo"

msgid "This program is running as %s and the packages installed for it are %s, so none of them can be loaded. This starts it right: %s"
msgstr "Ta program teče kot %s, paketi, nameščeni zanj, pa so %s, zato nobenega od njih ni mogoče naložiti. Pravilno se zažene tako: %s"

msgid "This handover carries no frame rate, so the timeline cannot be built from it. Please make the run again."
msgstr "Ta predaja ne vsebuje hitrosti sličic, zato iz nje ni mogoče zgraditi Timeline. Prosimo, ponovite zagon."

msgid "Cut by speaker"
msgstr "Montaža po govorcih"

msgid "Sync only"
msgstr "Samo sinhronizacija"

msgid "Project type"
msgstr "Vrsta projekta"

msgid "No project type chosen yet."
msgstr "Vrsta projekta še ni izbrana."

msgid "What is this production to become?"
msgstr "Kaj naj nastane iz te produkcije?"

msgid "\"%s\": the cameras on one time axis and a cut by who is speaking.\n\"%s\": the cameras on one time axis, nothing more -- no speakers, no cut."
msgstr "„%s“: kamere na eni časovni osi in montaža po tem, kdo govori.\n„%s“: kamere na eni časovni osi, nič več -- brez govorcev, brez montaže."

msgid "Sync only: no cut. The handover carries the multicam timeline alone; the Resolve project is created from the Output tab."
msgstr "Samo sinhronizacija: brez montaže. Predaja vsebuje le multicam Timeline; projekt Resolve se ustvari na zavihku „Izhod“."

msgid "Project type: Sync only -- no speakers, no transcript, no cut; the handover carries the multicam timeline alone."
msgstr "Vrsta projekta: Samo sinhronizacija -- brez govorcev, brez prepisa, brez montaže; predaja vsebuje le multicam Timeline."

msgid "\n  Sync only: no cut by speaker was asked for.\n  Only the Timeline for the multicam clip is built."
msgstr "\n  Samo sinhronizacija: montaža po govorcih ni bila zahtevana.\n  Zgradi se le Timeline za izrezek multicam."

msgid "  %s video tracks, named after the camera files:"
msgstr "  Video sledi: %s, poimenovane po datotekah kamer:"

msgid "Sync only takes one audio recording; this is one more: %s"
msgstr "Samo sinhronizacija sprejme en zvočni posnetek; to je še eden: %s"

msgid "Sync only: the handover is worked out again; there is no cut to redo. Resolve must be running."
msgstr "Samo sinhronizacija: predaja se znova izračuna; montaže za ponovitev ni. Resolve mora teči."

msgid "%s has not started yet"
msgstr "%s: še se ni začelo"

msgid "%s   --   the sound cannot be played"
msgstr "%s   --   zvoka ni mogoče predvajati"

msgid "sound placed by clock -- measurement pending"
msgstr "zvok postavljen po uri -- meritev še čaka"

msgid "\nSPEAKER LEVELS"
msgstr "\nRAVNI GOVORCEV"

msgid "Measuring %s"
msgstr "Merjenje: %s"

msgid "  %-20s not measurable -- left as it is"
msgstr "  %-20s ni merljivo -- ostane, kot je"

msgid "  %-20s %s LUFS -- nothing on it, left as it is"
msgstr "  %-20s %s LUFS -- nič na njej, ostane, kot je"

msgid "  %-20s %s LUFS  ->  %s dB"
msgstr "  %-20s %s LUFS  ->  %s dB"

msgid "  Only one voice -- nothing to match it against."
msgstr "  Le en glas -- ni ga s čim primerjati."

msgid "  Common level:      %s LUFS, the median of the voices"
msgstr "  Skupna raven:      %s LUFS, mediana glasov"

msgid "--new-name names %s, which is not one of the camera files of this run."
msgstr "--new-name navaja %s, ki ni ena od datotek kamer tega zagona."

msgid "The new name for %s is empty; give a plain file name or leave --new-name out."
msgstr "Novo ime za %s je prazno; navedite preprosto ime datoteke ali izpustite --new-name."

msgid "The new name \"%s\" for %s holds \"%s\", a folder or drive separator; give a plain file name."
msgstr "Novo ime „%s“ za %s vsebuje „%s“, ločilo za mapo ali pogon; navedite preprosto ime datoteke."

msgid "The new name \"%s\" for %s begins with a dot, which makes a hidden file or a folder; give a plain file name."
msgstr "Novo ime „%s“ za %s se začne s piko, kar ustvari skrito datoteko ali mapo; navedite preprosto ime datoteke."

msgid "Two cameras would be written as one file, %s: %s and %s."
msgstr "Dve kameri bi bili zapisani kot ena datoteka, %s: %s in %s."

msgid "--new-name gives %s two names, \"%s\" and \"%s\"; give each file one."
msgstr "--new-name da datoteki %s dve imeni, „%s“ in „%s“; vsaki datoteki dajte eno."

msgid "The assignment file names the cameras here, so --new-name would be dropped; give the names there or leave --new-name out."
msgstr "Datoteka dodelitve tukaj poimenuje kamere, zato bi bil --new-name prezrt; navedite imena tam ali izpustite --new-name."

msgid "With cameras only, each file is named after the tracks taken from its sound, so --new-name would be dropped; leave --new-name out."
msgstr "Kadar so samo kamere, se vsaka datoteka imenuje po sledeh, vzetih iz njenega zvoka, zato bi bil --new-name prezrt; izpustite --new-name."

msgid "on %s camera"
msgid_plural "on %s cameras"
msgstr[0] "na %s kameri"
msgstr[1] "na %s kamerah"
msgstr[2] "na %s kamerah"
msgstr[3] "na %s kamerah"

msgid "  %s word came back without a time and was left out."
msgid_plural "  %s words came back without a time and were left out."
msgstr[0] "  %s beseda se je vrnila brez časovne oznake in je bila izpuščena."
msgstr[1] "  %s besedi sta se vrnili brez časovne oznake in sta bili izpuščeni."
msgstr[2] "  %s besede so se vrnile brez časovne oznake in so bile izpuščene."
msgstr[3] "  %s besed se je vrnilo brez časovne oznake in je bilo izpuščenih."

msgid "  Speaker separation (%s): %s speaker out of %s of audio"
msgid_plural "  Speaker separation (%s): %s speakers out of %s of audio"
msgstr[0] "  Ločevanje govorcev (%s): %s govorec iz %s zvoka"
msgstr[1] "  Ločevanje govorcev (%s): %s govorca iz %s zvoka"
msgstr[2] "  Ločevanje govorcev (%s): %s govorci iz %s zvoka"
msgstr[3] "  Ločevanje govorcev (%s): %s govorcev iz %s zvoka"

msgid "Separated: %s speaker"
msgid_plural "Separated: %s speakers"
msgstr[0] "Ločeno: %s govorec"
msgstr[1] "Ločeno: %s govorca"
msgstr[2] "Ločeno: %s govorci"
msgstr[3] "Ločeno: %s govorcev"

msgid "%s fixed on its own"
msgid_plural "%s fixed on their own"
msgstr[0] "%s samodejno odpravljeno"
msgstr[1] "%s samodejno odpravljeni"
msgstr[2] "%s samodejno odpravljena"
msgstr[3] "%s samodejno odpravljenih"

msgid "    Picture and audio linked again: %s angle"
msgid_plural "    Picture and audio linked again: %s angles"
msgstr[0] "    Slika in zvok znova povezana: %s kot"
msgstr[1] "    Slika in zvok znova povezana: %s kota"
msgstr[2] "    Slika in zvok znova povezana: %s koti"
msgstr[3] "    Slika in zvok znova povezana: %s kotov"

msgid "  Caution: %s not inserted. Without this angle the\n  Timeline is no good for converting."
